owledge Base','Detailed Feature Grid'=>'Detailed Feature Grid','Contact Us'=>'Contact Us','Purchase'=>'Purchase','Hide'=>'Hide','None. All %ss will be hidden by default.'=>'None. All %ss will be hidden by default.','Add Selected Permissions'=>'Add Selected Permissions','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.','Upgrade to Pro'=>'Upgrade to Pro','Request Support'=>'Request Support','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.','View Knowledge Base'=>'View Knowledge Base','All settings were updated.'=>'All settings were updated.','All settings were reset to defaults.'=>'All settings were reset to defaults.','Save Changes'=>'Save Changes','Upgrade to Permissions Pro'=>'Upgrade to Permissions Pro','Need Permissions Support?'=>'Need Permissions Support?','If disabled, manually "blocked" posts can be unblocked by specific Category / Term Permissions.'=>'If disabled, manually "blocked" posts can be unblocked by specific Category / Term Permissions.','If enabled, corresponding Media edit and delete capabilities must be added to existing roles.'=>'If enabled, corresponding Media edit and delete capabilities must be added to existing roles.','For specialized Media Library permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature.'=>'For specialized Media Library permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature.','To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate the Compatibility Pack feature.'=>'To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate the Compatibility Pack feature.','To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate your Permissions Pro license key.'=>'To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate your Permissions Pro license key.','Remove the "Private:" and "Protected" prefix from Post, Page titles.'=>'Remove the "Private:" and "Protected" prefix from Post, Page titles.','If the user is blocked from reading posts in a category, also block access to category archive page.'=>'If the user is blocked from reading posts in a category, also block access to category archive page.','Remove unreadable Menu Items. If menu rendering problems occur with a third party plugin, disable this setting.'=>'Remove unreadable Menu Items. If menu rendering problems occur with a third party plugin, disable this setting.','Unmodified from WordPress default behavior. To enable filtering, remove constant definition PP_ADMIN_READONLY_LISTABLE.'=>'Unmodified from WordPress default behavior. To enable filtering, remove constant definition PP_ADMIN_READONLY_LISTABLE.','Note: Groups and Roles are always displayed on the Edit User screen.'=>'Note: Groups and Roles are always displayed on the Edit User screen.','Disable Permissions filtering for users who are not logged in.'=>'Disable Permissions filtering for users who are not logged in.','Legacy compatibility: front end term filters are not applied on some sites.'=>'Legacy compatibility: front end term filters are not applied on some sites.','If checked, pages blocked from the "All" or "Logged In" groups will still be listed to Administrators.'=>'If checked, pages blocked from the "All" or "Logged In" groups will still be listed to Administrators.','If enabled, users with the pp_set_read_exceptions capability in the WP role can set reading permissions for their editable posts.'=>'If enabled, users with the pp_set_read_exceptions capability in the WP role can set reading permissions for their editable posts.','Display a role dropdown alongside the user search input box to narrow results.'=>'Display a role dropdown alongside the user search input box to narrow results.','Display descriptive captions on Permissions screens.'=>'Display descriptive captions on Permissions screens.','Display descriptive captions for features available in missing or deactivated modules.'=>'Display descriptive captions for features available in missing or deactivated modules.','Extra Roles cause "_posts" capabilities in the Pattern Role (Author, Editor, etc.) to be assigned for the selected post type. Enable this setting to also include all other capabilities in the Pattern Role.'=>'Extra Roles cause "_posts" capabilities in the Pattern Role (Author, Editor, etc.) to be assigned for the selected post type. Enable this setting to also include all other capabilities in the Pattern Role.','Detect user roles which are appended dynamically but not stored to the WP database. May be useful for sites that sync with Active Directory or other external user registration systems.'=>'Detect user roles which are appended dynamically but not stored to the WP database. May be useful for sites that sync with Active Directory or other external user registration systems.','You can adjust some Permissions behavior by %1$s adding capabilities to a WordPress role%2$s.'=>'You can adjust some Permissions behavior by %1$s adding capabilities to a WordPress role%2$s.','You can add Permissions capabilities to a role using the %1$s plugin.'=>'You can add Permissions capabilities to a role using the %1$s plugin.','Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_read_exceptions capability is also required.'=>'Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_read_exceptions capability is also required.','Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_edit_exceptions capability is also required.'=>'Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_edit_exceptions capability is also required.','Settings related to content editing permissions, provided by the %s module.'=>'Settings related to content editing permissions, provided by the %s module.','If this setting is disabled, you can enable a role by giving it capabilities: list_others_posts, list_others_published_pages, etc.'=>'If this setting is disabled, you can enable a role by giving it capabilities: list_others_posts, list_others_published_pages, etc.','Display a custom column on Edit Posts screen for all related taxonomies which are enabled for Permissions filtering.'=>'Display a custom column on Edit Posts screen for all related taxonomies which are enabled for Permissions filtering.','Allows creation of a new post (of any type) for each selected user, using an existing post as the pattern.'=>'Allows creation of a new post (of any type) for each selected user, using an existing post as the pattern.','Other users will be unable to publish new top-level pages (Parent = "Main Page"), or move a published page from "Main Page" to a different Parent.'=>'Other users will be unable to publish new top-level pages (Parent = "Main Page"), or move a published page from "Main Page" to a different Parent.','This feature has been moved to PublishPress Capabilities > Editor Features > Element IDs. Please use the Capabilities plugin for better organization and enhanced functionality.'=>'This feature has been moved to PublishPress Capabilities > Editor Features > Element IDs. Please use the Capabilities plugin for better organization and enhanced functionality.','The following settings are currently overridden by the constant PP_MEDIA_LIB_UNFILTERED (defined in wp-config.php or some other file you maintain). Media Library access will not be altered by Permissions.'=>'The following settings are currently overridden by the constant PP_MEDIA_LIB_UNFILTERED (defined in wp-config.php or some other file you maintain). Media Library access will not be altered by Permissions.','Show files uploaded by others users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to view.'=>'Show files uploaded by others users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to view.','Show files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'Show files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.','Allow users to edit files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'Allow users to edit files uploaded by other user